flowchart TD
    A([开始]) --> B["收到报文(deviceId, seq, timestamp)"]

    B --> C["读取 last_seq[deviceId]"]

    C --> D{seq ≤ last_seq}

    D -->|是| E["拒绝报文-重放攻击日志"]
    D -->|否| F{"timestamp时间戳检查"}

    F -->|超时| G["拒绝报文-时间戳超限日志"]
    F -->|正常| H["更新last_seq[deviceId]=seq"]

    H --> I["进入正常验签流程"]

    E --> J([结束])
    G --> J
    I --> J

    style E fill:#ff6b6b
    style G fill:#ff6b6b
    style I fill:#51cf66